                {
                    "id": "752490101",
                    "speaker": "Malinche",
                    "text": "Hi there! Have you seen my friend around here? His name's Wayner."
                },
                {
                    "id": "752490102",
                    "speaker": "Malinche",
                    "text": "He said he needed a moment 'cause \"nature calls,\" and then he disappeared! He wouldn't have run off and ditched me, would he?"
                },
                {
                    "id": "752490103",
                    "speaker": "Malinche",
                    "text": "Anyway... if you bump into him, please tell him I'm waiting."
